    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d860">

                <pb facs="1101" n="999" xml:id="pg999"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">681.003/122: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-01-08T16:00:00+00:00">January 8, 1935—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received January 8—1:45 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4. My telegram No. 3, January 7, 1 p.m.<anchor n="93" xml:id="d860-f1"/>
                    Following submission of formal protests today as directed in the Department’s
                    65, December 15, 2 p.m.,<anchor n="94" xml:id="d860-f2"/> No. 66, December 20, 8
                        p.m.,<anchor n="95" xml:id="d860-f3"/> and 68, December 29, 3 p.m.,<anchor
                        n="96" xml:id="d860-f4"/> conference took place with all Moroccan experts of
                    Foreign Office.</p>
                <p>Subsecretary states no agreement yet come to with France concerning proposed new
                    customs regime Morocco.<anchor n="97" xml:id="d860-f5"/>
                </p>
                <p>Foreign Office ready to enter into full and friendly examination of 1928
                        claims<anchor n="98" xml:id="d860-f6"/> and recognition of Spanish Zone
                    conferences will probably begin tomorrow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
